sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Cache-aside keeps authority in the existing database
    accDescr: The AWS application checks ElastiCache for an article. On a miss it reads the on-premises database and fills the cache. Comments continue to be written to the authoritative database.
    participant A as AWS web application
    participant C as ElastiCache Multi-AZ
    participant D as On-premises database
    A->>C: Look up article
    alt Valid cache entry
        C-->>A: Cached article
    else Cache miss
        C-->>A: Not found or expired
        A->>D: Read article across hybrid link
        D-->>A: Authoritative article
        A->>C: Cache article with expiration
    end
    Note over A,C: Invalidate entries when articles change
    A->>D: Persist new comment
    D-->>A: Write confirmation
